  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/505704/diamond-spheres-invention-and-ingenuity?affiliate_id=3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Invention &amp; Ingenuity</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Associated skill 5 ranks</p>\n<p><strong>Refinement DC:</strong> 25</p>\n<p>You harvest the parts of a creature that are highly magical, such as a unicorn’s horn or pixie dust. A refined reagent can be expended as part of casting a spell or magical sphere effect to improve it, allowing the user to choose one of the following benefits to add to the effect:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The effect’s range increases by 10 feet (as long as it has a range greater than touch), or its area by 5 feet. These increase by 5 feet for every 5 associated ranks you possess.</li>\n<li>The user rolls any concentration checks made as part of creating or maintaining the effect twice and takes the highest result.</li>\n<li>The effect gains a +1 alchemical bonus to its MSB and MSD, +1 per 10 associated ranks. The user can expend a reagent when attempting a dispel check made as part of hack magic to confer this bonus to the attempt.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Potency:</strong> The refined reagent gains two additional uses before it becomes expended.</p>\n<p><strong>Talisman:</strong> A reagent talisman grants its wearer a +2 alchemical bonus to concentration checks and a +1 alchemical bonus to their MSB and MSD. Additionally, once per hour the wearer can grant themselves a +1 alchemical bonus to their caster level as part of casting a spell or magical sphere effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Potency:</strong> The bonuses granted by the reagent talisman increases by 1.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/survivalism#toc39\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
